@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_RESPONSE

### Health: 200, {"status":"ok"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login: copy token from response into the variable above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"alice","password":"Study123!"}

### Own team: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Own task: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Foreign task with history: 404, no task data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No session: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1

### Create: 201; authorId is ignored, saved author is alice (1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Учебная задача","description":"Подготовить описание API.","assigneeId":2,"authorId":4}

### Foreign assignee: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Учебная задача","description":"Не должна сохраниться.","assigneeId":5}

### Self-assignment: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Учебная задача","description":"Не должна сохраниться.","assigneeId":1}
